<div>
    <table>
        <tr>
            <th>
                Operation Name
            </th>
            <th>
                Service 1
            </th>
            <th>
                Service 2
            </th>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>
                TransientOperation
            </td>
            <td>
                @ViewBag.TransientOperation1
            </td>
            <td>
                @ViewBag.TransientOperation2
            </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>
                ScopedOperation
            </td>
            <td>
                @ViewBag.ScopedOperation1
            </td>
            <td>
                @ViewBag.ScopedOperation2
            </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>
                SingletonOperation
            </td>
            <td>
                @ViewBag.SingletonOperation1
            </td>
            <td>
                @ViewBag.SingletonOperation2
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>
</div>

<div>
    <p>🔴 Transient: Her refresh'te değişir — her injection'da yeni instance</p>
    <p>🟡 Scoped: Aynı request içinde sabit, yeni request'te değişir</p>
    <p>🟢 Singleton: Uygulama kapanana kadar hiç değişmez</p>
</div>